{"version":1,"content":"<p>如果字節跳動上市，段永平會不會買它的股票？這位知名投資人今日在雪球回應網友時表示，<strong>字節跳動目前的市場估值大概在6000億美元，「這個價錢我會有興趣的」。</strong>提問的網友認為，字節跳動實力很強，已經在一定程度上分流了其他互聯網企業的用户。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587274.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:01.980066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:03:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_hash":"ee62f0e42518b5bc875e8f906c34a246ce98cdb09cb27cedc41a729ab3a52615","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}